# Adapted from Polestar's guide forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes (GPL-3.0, github.com/fitzforge/polestar, tag v0.3.4).
# Changes: guide id, title, folder, next guide, group notes. Quest steps kept as Polestar wrote them,
# except where a comment marked "Groupe Alliance" says otherwise.
guide groupe-alliance/27-steppes-ardentes
title Group 25 · Burning Steppes & Azshara
folder Group Alliance
faction Alliance
levels 50-53
zone Burning Steppes
next groupe-alliance/28-gangrebois

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: A Taste of Flame (4023).
# Left out: Dark Iron Legacy (3801).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Azshara

step Shadowsong Shrine
  note Everyone at their own pace: what you already did ticks itself, the guide picks up where you are. Playing together? Group XP is best within 4 levels.
  zone Azshara
  tip The shrine lies in the south-west corner of Azshara, south of Talrendis Point.
  getfp "Talrendis Point"
  accept 5535                         -- Loh'atu
  accept 5536
  kill 6116 quest 5535.1              -- Highborne Apparition
  kill 6117 quest 5535.2              -- Highborne Lichling

step Azshara: kill these as you meet them
  zone Azshara
  tip The Highborne ghosts haunt the ruins around the shrine; the Haldarr satyrs hold the camp just north of it.
  kill 6127 quest 5536.3              -- Haldarr Felsworn
  kill 6126 quest 5536.2              -- Haldarr Trickster
  kill 6125 quest 5536.1              -- Haldarr Satyr

step Shadowsong Shrine
  turnin 5535                         -- Loh'atu
  turnin 5536

step Azshara
  only Priest
  zone Azshara
  goto 42.4,42.6 "Azshara"

step Ogtinc
  zone Azshara
  only Priest
  tip Ride north-east from the shrine: Ogtinc camps at the Bear's Head, in the hills above the road.
  turnin 8254                         -- Ogtinc
  accept 8255

step Mosshoof Coursers
  zone Azshara
  only Priest
  tip The nearest Mosshoof Coursers graze the hills north-east of the Bear's Head, toward the Legashi Encampment; a larger herd roams the open ground to the south.
  collect 20027 quest 8255.1          -- Healthy Courser Gland

step Azshara
  only Priest
  zone Azshara
  goto 42.4,42.6 "Azshara"

step Ogtinc
  zone Azshara
  only Priest
  turnin 8255                         -- Ogtinc
  accept 8256

step Sanath Lim-yo
  zone Azshara
  tip Optional: Sanath Lim-yo wants two Undamaged Hippogryph Feathers from the hippogryphs around his camp. The data lists no experience for it.
  accept 3381 optional
  collect 10450 quest 3381.1 optional
  turnin 3381 optional
  level 50.56                          -- grind on Thunderhead Hippogryph

step Kim'jael
  tip Kim'jael camps at the Legashi Encampment in the north; his equipment lies all over the Thalassian Base Camp just south-east of him.
  accept 3601
  collect 10717 quest 3601.1          -- Kim'Jael's Compass
  collect 10715 quest 3601.2          -- Kim'Jael's Scope
  collect 10722 quest 3601.3          -- Kim'Jael's Stuffed Chicken
  collect 10718 quest 3601.4          -- Kim'Jael's Wizzlegoober
  turnin 3601
  accept 5534
  level 50.65                          -- grind on Spitelash Myrmidon

step The Ruins of Eldarath
  tip The Spitelash naga of the Ruins of Eldarath carry Some Rune. Tymor's four runes stand among the ruins: use his Drawing Kit on each.
  collect 10563 quest 3449.1          -- Rune of Beth'Amara
  level 50.69                          -- grind on Spitelash Myrmidon

step The Shattered Strand
  collect 13815 quest 5534.1

step Kim'jael
  turnin 5534

step The Ruins of Eldarath
  collect 10564 quest 3449.2          -- Rune of Jin'yael
  level 50.8                          -- grind on Spitelash Myrmidon
  collect 10565 quest 3449.3          -- Rune of Markri
  level 50.85                          -- grind on Spitelash Myrmidon

step Rubbing: Rune of Sael'hai
  collect 10566 quest 3449.4          -- Rune of Sael'hai
  collect 7972 quest 8256.1 only Priest -- Ichor of Undeath: the Lingering Highborne, about 10%

step Ogtinc
  only Priest
  turnin 8256 only Priest -- Ogtinc

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: the priests' last errand from Ogtinc, Blood of Morphaz (8257, after 8256 in
# Polestar's Forever data and the TrinityCore base; priests only, level 52, required 50), for whoever
# chose the Sunken Temple (`when group 1475`, asked in Group 22): Morphaz is fought in this guide's
# run, and Greta Mosshoof (Felwood 51.2,82.1) is at the Emerald Sanctuary, the first stop of Group 26.
step Ogtinc: Blood of Morphaz (Sunken Temple)
  only Priest
  when group 1475
  tip Ogtinc's last task for priests, Blood of Morphaz, is done in the Sunken Temple later in this guide; Greta Mosshoof, in Felwood, gives the reward at the start of the next guide. Each priest takes it here.
  accept 8257                         -- Ogtinc

step Ravencrest Monument
  tip Swim to the small island off the southern tip of Azshara: Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter waits by the monument.
  turnin 3449
  accept 3461

step Level 50.89
  when level<50.89
  tip Top up here to level 50.89 before the hand-ins at Dun Morogh: they take you to level 51.
  goto 48.8,43.4 map 1447 "Spitelash Myrmidon"
  level 50.89                          -- grind on Spitelash Myrmidon

# Groupe Alliance 0.7.0: hearthstone note (where the stone is bound at this point of the pack, and the way
# without it when it is still on cooldown). Text only, the step is Polestar's.
step To Stoutlager Inn
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Use your hearthstone: it is bound at the Stoutlager Inn, Thelsamar. On cooldown? Fly from Talrendis Point to Auberdine, take the boat to Menethil Harbor, then fly to Thelsamar.
  goto 35.5,48.4 "Stoutlager Inn"

step Fly to Ironforge
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 33.9,50.8 "Thelsamar flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 3461                         -- Tymor, Mystic Ward

step Fly to Morgan's Vigil
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Morgan's Vigil"
  zone Burning Steppes

step Morgan's Vigil
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Morgan's Vigil sits in the south-east of the Steppes, at the top of the pass up from Redridge.
  accept 3823

step Dreadmaul Rock
  tip The Firegut ogres hold the great rock north of the Vigil, with the Brutes on its east side.
  kill 7034 quest 3823.1              -- Firegut Ogre Mage, below ground
  kill 7033 quest 3823.2              -- Firegut Ogre
  kill 7035 quest 3823.3              -- Firegut Brute

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Morgan's Vigil

step Morgan's Vigil
  zone Burning Steppes
  accept 4283                         -- Oralius: the Blackrock orcs drop the medallions, keep it open all through the Steppes
  turnin 3823                         -- Oralius
  accept 3824

step Blackrock Medallion on the way
  along until q3701
  collect 11467 quest 4283.1

step Thaurissan Relic on the way
  along until q3701
  when onquest 3701
  interact 153556 quest 3701.1

step Level 51.39
  when level<51.39
  tip Top up here to level 51.39 before the hand-ins at Flame Crest: they take you to level 52.
  goto 78.7,44.7 map 1428 "Firegut Ogre Mage"
  level 51.39                          -- grind on Firegut Ogre Mage

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Flame Crest and the Ruins of Thaurissan

step Flame Crest
  tip Follow the road west, then climb north to the goblin camp on Flame Crest.
  accept 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  accept 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint

step Level 52
  when level<52
  tip Top up here to level 52 before the hand-ins at Flame Crest: they take you to level 53.
  goto 78.7,44.7 map 1428 "Firegut Ogre Mage"
  level 52                          -- grind on Firegut Ogre Mage

step Ruins of Thaurissan: kill these as you meet them
  label q3701
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip The relics are the carved stones scattered through the Ruins of Thaurissan around Flame Crest: click them until the information is recovered.
  tip Read the tablet in the Dark Iron camp among the ruins, south-west of Flame Crest, to copy the transcript.
  tip Use the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling on the slopes east of Flame Crest just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves.
  interact 153556 quest 3701.1        -- Thaurissan Relic
  collect 12283 quest 4726.1
  collect 11467 quest 4283.1
  use 12284 quest 4726.1 @72.4,28.2 map 1428
  collect 11470 quest 4296.1

step Flame Crest
  turnin 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  accept 4808                         -- Ends with Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Winterspring: keep it
  turnin 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint

step Cyrus Therepentous
  when group 4023
  accept 4023                         -- Below ground

step A Taste of Flame
  when group 4023
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Frenzied Black Drake is a level 54 elite: most classes solo it at level 56, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 10575 quest 4023.1 @94.4,31.8 map 1428

step Cyrus Therepentous
  when group 4023
  turnin 4023                         -- Below ground

step Level 52.08
  when !group 4023
  when level<52.08
  tip If you skipped A Taste of Flame, grind here to level 52.08 to stay on the route's plan.
  goto 89.6,51.2 map 1428 "Ember Worg"
  level 52.08                          -- grind on Ember Worg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Blackrock Stronghold

step Blackrock Stronghold
  tip Gor'tesh and the Blackrock orcs hold the camps and the stronghold at the foot of Blackrock Mountain, west of Flame Crest. Pull them one at a time; every orc and worg may drop a medallion, so kill them until you have fifty.
  tip Careful: Gor'tesh has a guard linked to him that joins the fight, and a second soldier patrols close by; clear the patrol before pulling.
  collect 11467 quest 4283.1          -- Blackrock Medallion; inside
  collect 11080 quest 3824.1          -- Gor'tesh

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to the Vigil

step Morgan's Vigil
  tip Ride back east along the road to the Vigil.
  turnin 4283                         -- Oralius
  turnin 3824
  accept 3825

step Dreadmaul Rock
  tip Climb to the top of Dreadmaul Rock and plant the head in the soft dirt mound.
  interact 160840 quest 3825.1        -- Soft Dirt Mound

step Morgan's Vigil
  turnin 3825                         -- Oralius
  vendor nearest

step Fly to Nethergarde Keep
  zone Burning Steppes
  goto 84.4,68.3 "Morgan's Vigil flight master"
  fly "Nethergarde Keep"
  zone Blasted Lands

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Blasted Lands

step Kum'isha the Collector
  tip Kum'isha waits at the Rise of the Defiler, the hill south-west of the keep. The Blasted Lands mobs on the way drop the Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments; bring her what you have.
  tip Careful: Felcular, Razelikh the Defiler and Ilifar are all level 60 elites. Razelikh casts Mana Burn, Strong Cleave and Decimate, and as its health drops it adds Razelikh's Tear, Flames of Chaos and then Enrage at 15%.
  accept 3501                         -- Kum'isha the Collector walks around here: look inside the circle on the map
  collect 10593 quest 3501.1
  turnin 3501

# Groupe Alliance 0.7.0: the Sunken Temple, for whoever took Into the Temple of Atal'Hakkar
# (1475) from Brohann in Stormwind (24-hinterlands, `when group 1475`). From the Blasted Lands
# north into the Swamp of Sorrows, the dungeon, then the hearthstone as before; Brohann at the
# Ironforge stop below (Deeprun Tram). Ids, levels and places from Polestar's Forever data and
# Dungeons codex; no Wowhead Forever comment could be read (blocked): every quest carries a "?".

step Sunken Temple (dungeon, optional): the Pool of Tears
  when group 1475
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Ride north out of the Blasted Lands into the Swamp of Sorrows, then east past Stonard (Horde) to the Pool of Tears. The temple lies under the water: swim down into it and find the dungeon's entrance inside.
  note Group of 5, levels 50 to 55. Keep 3 free quest log slots. Share each quest with your group: click it in the quest log, then Share.
  note In the quest log before going in: Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar (Brohann Caskbelly, Stormwind, Group 22). If you took them: Jammal'an the Prophet (Atal'ai Exile, Hinterlands, Group 22), and for priests Blood of Morphaz (Ogtinc, Azshara, earlier in this guide). Not on this route: Marvon Rivetseeker's two quests and The God Hakkar, which open only after this run, and the other classes' quests.
  goto 69.9,53.5 "Sunken Temple" r 25

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Jammal'an's head (1446, taken in Group 22) added to this step; the tip
# said it was not on the route. Jammal'an waits behind the six troll champions of the balconies of
# the upper level (Warcraft Tavern's Forever Sunken Temple quest guide, written from Classic: to
# check in game).
step Sunken Temple: the tablets and Jammal'an
  when group 1475
  tip The Atal'ai Tablets lie in the temple's halls: pick them up as you clear. Jammal'an the Prophet waits on the upper level, once the six troll champions of the balconies around the central pit are dead: his head is for the Atal'ai Exile's quest (Group 22), and every player who has it loots one.
  collect 6288 x10 quest 1475         -- Atal'ai Tablet
  collect 6212 quest 1446 optional    -- Head of Jammal'an: Jammal'an the Prophet

step Sunken Temple: Morphaz (priests)
  when group 1475
  when onquest 8257
  only Priest
  tip Morphaz, one of the green dragons on the way to the Shade of Eranikus, drops the Blood of Morphaz for the priest's quest.
  collect 20025 quest 8257            -- Blood of Morphaz: Morphaz

step Sunken Temple: the Shade of Eranikus
  when group 1475
  tip The Shade of Eranikus waits at the very end, past the green dragons. He drops the Essence of Eranikus: right-click it, then hand it in at the Essence Font in his room before you leave.
  accept 3373 item 10454 optional     -- Essence of Eranikus, a drop
  turnin 3373 object 148512 optional  -- Essence Font

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: a temple quest taken but not done (no run, or the boss missed) is dropped
# here: the route never comes back to the Sunken Temple.
step Jammal'an the Prophet: not done
  when onquest 1446
  when !complete 1446
  tip Jammal'an the Prophet needs the Sunken Temple, and the guide does not come back to it: abandon it.
  abandon 1446

step Blood of Morphaz: not done
  only Priest
  when onquest 8257
  when !complete 8257
  tip Blood of Morphaz needs the Sunken Temple, and the guide does not come back to it: abandon it.
  abandon 8257

