  tip Use your hearthstone (Stoutlager Inn, Thelsamar) if it is ready again. On cooldown? Fly from Nethergarde Keep to Thelsamar.
  goto 35.5,48.4 "Stoutlager Inn"

step Loch Modan
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 18.2,84.0 "Loch Modan"

