# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Hinterlands, Ironforge and Rut'theran

step Wildkin feathers
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip The Wildkin Feathers lie on the ground across the Hinterlands, south and east of Aerie Peak, where the owlbeasts roam; the mobs here are well below you now.
  collect 10819 quest 3661                    -- Wildkin Feather

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Jammal'an the Prophet (1446, Group 22) handed in at Shadra'Alor, a detour
# south from the feathers' hills (Atal'ai Exile 33.75,75.21).
step Atal'ai Exile
  when complete 1446
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Jammal'an's head: ride south to Shadra'Alor, the troll ruins in the south-west of the Hinterlands, west of the Altar of Zul. The Atal'ai Exile waits on a ledge beside the steps of one of the pyramids. A detour of about 10 minutes there and back.
  turnin 1446                                 -- Atal'ai Exile

step The Super Snapper FX
  when group 2944
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Gammerita (level 48 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 9330 quest 2944.1 @80.4,58.2 map 1425 group 2
  use 9328 quest 2944.1 @80.4,58.2 map 1425

step The Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 11.1,46.1 "The Hinterlands"

step Fly to Southshore
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 11.1,46.1 "Aerie Peak flight master"
  fly "Southshore"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

step Boat to Auberdine
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 50.6,69.9 "Boat to Auberdine"

step Fly to Rut'theran Village
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Rut'theran Village"
